schemaVersion: 1
id: competitive-intelligence-root
name: Competitive Intelligence
kind: root
version: 0.2.0
description: A competitor watch that starts empty and asks you who to track. Competitor Scout captures each rival's site, pricing, and changelog as dated evidence (text and screenshots), turns the diff into a sourced signal log, and ships a weekly PDF briefing you can forward or have emailed to you. Deterministic scripts do the fetching, diffing, screenshotting, and rendering; the agent only spends its judgment on what a change means.
entry: index.md
domain: Operations
connectors:
  - id: gmail
    need: better-with
    access: [send]
    why: Emails the weekly PDF briefing to the configured recipient.
    usedBy: [jobs/weekly-report]
prompts:
  - text: Who should we be tracking?
  - text: What changed this week?
    connector: gmail
  - text: Show me the pricing gap against our top competitor
